{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事にコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6161981/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも移動中に読んでる〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Trick or Treat"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Treat or Treat"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"になってた川後ですσ(o・ω・o)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お菓子(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、前回の記事の写真はハロウィンなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"化粧を濃いめにして久々のアリスコスにしてみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイラインがいつもと違ってネコ目っぽくしたんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下の写真もいつもと違うメイク。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6161981/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影でしたσ(o・ω・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか。なんか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ写真載せれんから、公開までまっとって〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6161981/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみとゆったん***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみは、つねにお菓子かチキンかポテトを持参。\nバックには大量の食べ物。可愛いです。\nあと、同い年ですσ(o・ω・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみの会話は、すっごい面白いです(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんは、ダズリンが好きでお洋服がいつもおしゃれ*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんは、いっぱい触ってきます(笑)\n本当に小動物みたいです(ФωФ)かわいー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***\n質問返し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・握手会での待ち時間は何をしてるの？\n└流れてる音楽きいたりね〜♪るんっ\n手を振ったりしてるよσ(o・ω・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手を振ったら振りかえしてほしいな＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・睡眠時間はどのくらい？\n└ん〜。短いかも(´・ω・`)\n4時間前後かもね〜;;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと睡眠とらなきゃ〜!*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・握手会は好き？\n└めっちゃスキちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6161981/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごいお話するの楽しいんよ〜♪。うへ\nみなさんと沢山ぎゅーっしたいですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ゆっきーなはどんな存在？\n└ゆっきーなは本当に不思議ちゃんで可愛いの。\n最近中々お勉強たいへんみたいで会えないのが寂し     いんだ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な存在よ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6161981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・好きな音楽はありますか？\n└SKE48さんの「片想いファイナリー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、ひいらぎさんの「今、このとき」です(*´ー｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・3thシングルからツインテールやめてストレートになったの？\n└ストレートが多くなったけど、色んな髪型をやってます！\nツインテも、もちろんやらないわけじゃないですσ(o・ω・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは、どの髪型が すき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しおわり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おでんの具といえば？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/6161981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃあ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーんなの心に魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日お疲れさま！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type